      "message": "This change is to enable _gather_ ops with u16 when converting hlsl -\u003e spv -\u003e wgsl.\n\nI removed the \"_OpSampledImage type must be a float_\" check to make it more permissive because an `OpImageGather` operation with a `OpSampledImage` with `uint` type is still valid:\n```spv\n%68 \u003d OpSampledImage %type_sampled_image %53 %54\n%69 \u003d OpImageGather %v4uint %68 %67 %int_0 None\n```\n\nI think it would be even better to let the check detect whether the `OpSampledImage` var is used by `OpImageGather` or `OpImageSample`, but I\u0027m not versed enough in the ast to determine if that\u0027s feasible.\n\nThanks for your review and any feedback 😊.",
